  <StreamGeometry x:Key="SelectAllGeo">M19,3 L5,3 C3.9,3 3,3.9 3,5 L3,19 C3,20.1 3.9,21 5,21 L19,21 C20.1,21 21,20.1 21,19 L21,5 C21,3.9 20.1,3 19,3z M19,19 L5,19 L5,5 L19,5z M17.99,9 L16.58,7.58 L9.99,14.17 L7.41,11.6 L5.99,13.01 L9.99,17z</StreamGeometry>

